;-------------------------------------------------
; eraTheWorld 4.763用 チルノ口上大妖精なりきり対応（キャラクターの名前を入れる、下にコンセプトなど一言あれば入れる）
;-------------------------------------------------
;他者による修正、加筆、改変については、同梱のライセンス条項に従ってください。

;------ ｷﾘﾄﾘ ｶｲｼ -----------
;eraTheWorld proto4.07パッチ取り込み用 Ver1.13
;テンプレートの使い方
;初めに置換コマンド等により K14 を K(キャラNo) に変更して下さい  
;キャラNoはCSVフォルダのCharaファイルを参照　例(霧雨 魔理沙の場合)：K14 =置換=> K11
;自分用メモ
;あといちいちRESETCOLORとかしないで色付きメッセージを出す関数、@COLORMESSAGE(ARGS,色,表示形式,太字)を設置。
;表示形式は0でPRINTFORM、1でPRINTFORML、2でPRINTFORMWで表示します。
;
;使用例：CALL COLORMESSAGE("",C_AQUA,2,0)
;使用例：CALL COLORMESSAGE("",C_GREEN,2,0)
;------ ｷﾘﾄﾘ ｵﾜﾘ -----------

;**** FlagManagement **********************************************************
;本口上にて使用しているCFLAG・TCVAR等
;CFLAG:14:1001　大妖精でない場合でも口上を全て表示させるフラグです。
;CFLAG:14:1002　チルノの思慕口上を表示させるフラグです。
;CFLAG:14:1003　カエルフラグです。チルノにアイテムをあげると上昇。一定以上になるとアイテムをくれる。
;custom code
;CFLAG:14:1101  Started training
;CFLAG:14:1102  Defeats in Danmaku
;CFLAG:14:1103  Defeated at strongest
;CFLAG:14:1104  Last challenge day
;CFLAG:14:1105  Allow rematch challenges
;******************************************************************************

;### 口上存在判定 ###################################
@M_KOJO_K14(ARG)
;別人版を作成する際はこのテンプレではなく別人版用口上テンプレをご利用ください

;口上存在判定です、けしてコメントアウトしないでください
;他の処理は一切行わないように
RETURN 1

;### 口上基本フラグ設定 #############################
@M_KOJO_FLAGSETTING_K14
;基本フラグ設定はここで行ってください
;共通の口上フラグは必要な箇所のコメントアウトを外してご利用ください
;口上専用フラグはご自由に
;Xにはキャラ番号を入れてください

;眠姦口上有、時間停止口上有、なりきりに1を入れると、それぞれ時間停止時、眠姦時、なりきり時にコマンド口上が読み込まれるように
;入れないと時間停止時、眠姦時、なりきり時は一切喋りません
;CFLAG:X:眠姦口上有 = 0
;CFLAG:X:時間停止口上有 = 0
CFLAG:14:なりきり口上有 = 1

;custom code, temporary measure to enforce the friend flag when yearning is removed after reaching an advanced relationship state
IF (TALENT:14:恋慕 || TALENT:14:愛欲) && !TALENT:14:思慕 && CFLAG:14:1002 != 1
	PRINTFORML Advanced relationship with Cirno reached, friend flag engaged...
	PRINTFORML (This will output [Yearning] lines, as there are no [Love] lines at the moment.)
	CFLAG:14:1002 = 1
ENDIF

;破瓜キャンセル口上有に1を入れると、@M_KOJO_EVENT_KX_LOST_VIRGIN_STOPでキャンセルの成否を操作できます
;CFLAG:X:破瓜キャンセル口上有 = 0

;口上内抱き寄せ判定_初回と口上内抱き寄せ判定_通常に1を入れると、M_KOJO_EVENT_KX_PERMISSIONで押し倒しの成否を操作できます
;CFLAG:X:口上内抱き寄せ判定_初回 = 0
;CFLAG:X:口上内抱き寄せ判定_通常 = 0

;押し倒し禁止に1を入れると、自分から押し倒してこなくなります
;以下は恋慕かセフレがつくまで押し倒してこなくなる使用例
;IF !TALENT:X:恋慕 && !TALENT:X:セフレ
;	CFLAG:X:押し倒し禁止 = 1
;ELSE
;	CFLAG:X:押し倒し禁止 = 0
;ENDIF

;来訪不能に1を入れると、来訪してこなくなります
;以下は面識があるまで来訪してこなくなる使用例
;IF !CFLAG:X:面識
;	CFLAG:X:来訪不能 = 1
;ELSE
;	CFLAG:X:来訪不能 = 0
;ENDIF

;### 口上色判定 ###################################
@M_KOJO_COLOR_K14
SETCOLOR C_AQUA
;ここでSETCOLORすることで口上に色を付けられます
;例：SETCOLOR 0xf7c9ff
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;"UPDATE判定"
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
@M_KOJO_UPDATE_K14
;口上独自のUPDATE用
;ENCOUNTER専用に独自分岐フラグを仕込んだ場合等にどうぞ
;UPDATE判定でCFLAG等のキャラ変数を使う場合、キャラ番号の指定が必要になります
RETURN 1

;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;Custom dialogue settings, custom code
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;made it as a way to speed up the update process and separate simple flag updates from various customization options
;note: options start from 1!
@KOJO_OPTION_K14
SIF CFLAG:14:1101
	CALL KOJO_OPTION_ITEM(@"Allow rematch challenges", 1, "cond", CFLAG:14:1101 && !CFLAG:14:1103, "status:Enabled:Disabled", CFLAG:14:1105 == 1)

;process the input portion
@KOJO_OPTION_K14_RESULT_1
PRINTFORMDL Cirno can challenge you to a Danmaku match when meeting you.
PRINTFORMDL Do you wish to enable those?
CALL ASK_YN
IF !RESULT
	PRINTFORMDW Cirno will periodically challenge you for the title of the strongest.
	CFLAG:14:1105 = 0
ELSE
	PRINTFORMDW Cirno will restrain herself and not bother you too much.
	CFLAG:14:1105 = 1
ENDIF

;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;"ENCOUNTER"系イベント（エクストラ構文）
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
@M_KOJO_ENCOUNTER_K14
;初対面、挨拶のタイミング
;TALENTの変更はここでどうぞ。
;経験の変更は齟齬が出る場合がありますので、CSVを修正し同梱する事を推奨します
#DIM LCOUNT

IF FLAG:なりきり == 13
	;あなたが大妖精の場合非表示
	ELSE
	;あなたが大妖精でない場合に表示
	SETCOLOR C_AQUA
	PRINTFORML This Cirno dialogue is designed for playing as Daiyousei.
	PRINTFORML As you're not playing as her, some sections will not be shown.
	PRINTFORML Select one of the following actions.
	$LOOP
	PRINTFORML 
	PRINTFORML 
	PRINTFORML 
	PRINTFORML [0] Use it as is (Part of the text will be hidden)
	PRINTFORML [1] Disguise yourself as Daiyousei (Show everything regardless)
	INPUT
	SELECTCASE RESULT
		CASE 0
			PRINTFORMW Majority of Daiyousei-specific responses will be hidden.
		CASE 1
			CFLAG:14:1001 = 1
			PRINTFORM For Cirno, you became 
			IF TALENT:MASTER:性別 == 2
				SELECTCASE TALENT:MASTER:年齢
					CASE -1
						PRINTFORMW Daiyousei, except with a dick between your legs.
					CASE 2
						PRINTFORMW an Orphan of Kos.
					CASEELSE
						PRINTFORMW Daiyousei.
						PRINTFORML 
						PRINTFORML 
						PRINTFORMW You are Daiyousei alright, no matter what anyone says!
					ENDSELECT
				ELSE
					PRINTFORMW Daiyousei(Fake).
					SIF TALENT:MASTER:バストサイズ < 0
						PRINTFORMW Usually her chest area has a little more size to it, but it's a small problem.
			ENDIF
		CASEELSE
			GOTO LOOP
		ENDSELECT
ENDIF



PRINTFORMW Please do tell how you and Cirno-chan get along.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML [0] First meeting
PRINTFORML [1] Close friends ([Yearning] responses will be used from the start)
PRINTFORML %BREAKENG(@"(Note that because the author didn't implement Love/Lover responses yet, and Yearning is removed after Love is reached, the dialogue will regress to basic responses.)")%
PRINTFORML (In those cases, the "friend" flag will be enforced to return more warm lines.)
;PRINTFORMW [2] 赤ちゃんつくろ%UNICODE(0x2665) *1%
;Unused option, "Had a baby with"
$INPUT_LOOP_K14_ENCOUNTER
INPUT 
IF RESULT == 0
	PRINTFORMW It seems you and Cirno are going to become friends in the near future.
	CFLAG:14:1002 = 2
ELSEIF RESULT == 1
	CFLAG:14:1002 = 1
	PRINTFORMW You're already good friends with Cirno.
;ELSEIF RESULT == 2
	;PRINTFORMW %CALLNAME:MASTER%はチルノの嫁(自称)です。
	;Unused text for option 2, "x is Cirno's wife(self-proclaimed)"
ELSE
	IF LCOUNT >5
		PRINTFORMW Come on man, are you blind?! I told you there's no such option, sheesh!
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMW No such option.
		LCOUNT ++
	ENDIF
	GOTO INPUT_LOOP_K14_ENCOUNTER
ENDIF
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML 

IF CFLAG:14:1002 == 1
	SETCOLOR C_GREEN
	PRINTFORML I am Daiyousei. Everyone calls me Dai-chan. 
	CALL COLORMESSAGE14("「Oiiー!」",C_AQUA,2,0)
	CALL COLORMESSAGE14("「Dai-chan! Over here, over here!」",C_AQUA,2,0)
	PRINTFORML That voice calling out to me is Cirno, the Ice Fairy.
	PRINTFORML She's very lively, and quite strong too... I'm proud to call her my friend.
	PRINTFORML 「Cirno-chan! Fufu, you're full of energy today too.」
	CALL COLORMESSAGE14("「Of course I am! There's never a day where I'm feeling down! So, what're we playing today?」",C_AQUA,2,0)
	PRINTFORML Just another day of two close friends playing games. But today, there's something important I have to tell her.
	PRINTFORML And that is...
	PRINTFORML 「......Cirno-chan. Ummm... Before we go play, can I tell you something?」
	CALL COLORMESSAGE14("「Hmー?」",C_AQUA,2,0)
	PRINTFORML 「That is...」
	PRINTFORML 「......」
	PRINTFORMW 「S-Sorry. I forgot...」
	CALL COLORMESSAGE14("「What was that all aboutー! Well whatever. You'll probly remember while were playing!」",C_AQUA,2,0) 
	PRINTFORML 「...Yes, you're right. So what are we going to play?」 
	CALL COLORMESSAGE14("「Today were gonna go exploring! That Black and white was telling me all about the other day when she was in hell―――」",C_AQUA,2,0)
	PRINTFORMW ......In the end, I never told her.
	PRINTFORML That I have the ability... to stop time.
	PRINTFORML At first, I was afraid that a yellow robot would pop out of nowhere... 
	PRINTFORML I discovered I had this power once I've gotten really close to Cirno-chan.
	PRINTFORML When I first realized, I was really happy.
	PRINTFORMW "I have an amazing ability that's similar to that Maid-san's!"...Or so I thought.
	PRINTFORMW But...
	PRINTFORML I also realized just how frightening this ability really is.
	PRINTFORML You can do whatever you want while time is stopped.
	PRINTFORMW And nobody notices what happens in a world where time has stopped.
	PRINTFORML 
	PRINTFORMW And if I were to do something... Nobody will figure out that it was me.
	PRINTFORML 
	PRINTFORMW ......
	PRINTFORML 
	PRINTFORMW Sigh... Just how should I use this power?
ELSE
	PRINTFORML 「Hmm? Who're you?」
	PRINTFORML 「Haven't seen you around here before. Where do you live, fairy?」
	SIF FLAG:なりきり != [[大妖精]] && CFLAG:14:1001 != 1 ;custom code fix
		PRINTFORML 「You're not a fairy? Well that doesn't really matter.」
	PRINTFORML 「To begin with, this is my turf, so if you're here that can only mean...」
	PRINTFORML 「That you want to be my apprentice, right?」
	PRINTFORML 「Must be the price I gotta pay for being the strongest...」
	PRINTFORML 「All right! I've decided, you'll be you my apprentice!」
	PRINTFORML 「For starters, I want you to be my playmate. Also, I want you to do a good job of spreading my name around.」
	PRINTFORML 「You don't know my name? I'm the strongest ice fairy, Cirno! Don't you forget it.」
	PRINTFORML 「And what's your name? Hmm, you're %CALLNAME:MASTER%? ...That's too hard to say so I won't bother.」 
	PRINTFORMW 「Alright! Let's go and have some fun! Follow my lead!」
ENDIF
RESETCOLOR
RETURN 1

