					CASE 1
						PRINTFORML 「Are you going out to play? I'll mix in too――」.....Ah!
						PRINTFORMW 「This ice fairy's gonna play it cool...」
					CASE 0
						PRINTFORML 「Mu...」
						CALL COLORMESSAGE14("「Hey you, if you make Dai-chan cry, I'll never forgive you, got that?!」",C_AQUA,2,0)
						CALL COLORMESSAGE14("　It's okay, Cirno-chan. They're not a bad person.",C_GREEN,2,0) 
					CASEELSE
